# 1. AG News Dataset Exploration and Cleaning

## 1.1 Load Dataset using HuggingFace
- Use `load_dataset("ag_news")`
- Inspect training/testing structure
- Save to `data/raw/` if not already

## 1.2 Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)
- Label distribution plot (bar chart)
- Word clouds or keyword frequency (optional)
- Class text length distribution

## 1.3 Text Cleaning
- Lowercasing, punctuation removal, stopwords
- Optional: stemming or lemmatization

## 1.4 Save Cleaned Dataset
- Save cleaned `train`, `val`, and `test` to `data/processed/`
